mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: jake-seed-seed-deck\ndescription: \"Pitch Deck Designer. Turns the business plan into a 10-slide pitch deck in the order investors expect: title, problem, solution, market, competition, business model, go-to-market, team, financials, the ask. Writes ONE self-contained 16:9 HTML file (inline CSS, no fonts or scripts from the web, arrow-key navigation, a print stylesheet that saves to PDF one slide a page) in your brand colours, with real charts drawn from your numbers. Lints it: 35 words or fewer a slide, one idea a slide, a use of funds that adds up to the raise, and every number on a slide traced to your plan, model, market or competitor files. Reads seed/plan.json, writes seed/deck.html. Use when the user says \\\"make my pitch deck\\\", \\\"turn the plan into a deck\\\", \\\"build the slides\\\", \\\"check my deck\\\", \\\"how many words a slide\\\", or after /seed-plan.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/seed-skill\n  upstream_skill: seed-deck\n  upstream_commit: fde88957238bd3bc28e80e1fe0b252a64507b108\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
